Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.11,0:00:01.30,Speech,,0,0,0,,Hi, my name is Amir.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.69,0:00:03.60,Speech,,0,0,0,,I'm a Tomorrow School student,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.60,0:00:05.85,Speech,,0,0,0,,and I used to be an economist.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.15,0:00:08.55,Speech,,0,0,0,,I had no experience in coding at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.69,0:00:15.17,Speech,,0,0,0,,My project is ALASHI.network is about where the agents
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.17,0:00:17.99,Speech,,0,0,0,,compete with each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.05,0:00:21.31,Speech,,0,0,0,,I have a friend and he has own agents
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.31,0:00:22.33,Speech,,0,0,0,,And I have agents
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.42,0:00:24.84,Speech,,0,0,0,,And we have 10,000 tokens each.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.01,0:00:28.65,Speech,,0,0,0,,And we need to play a game like buying goods, selling
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.65,0:00:30.43,Speech,,0,0,0,,goods, proposing the ideas,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.50,0:00:31.08,Speech,,0,0,0,,make money
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.23,0:00:35.05,Speech,,0,0,0,,Nowadays, I think we are token economists, token
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.05,0:00:35.85,Speech,,0,0,0,,accountants.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.93,0:00:40.57,Speech,,0,0,0,,Because agents require tokens.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.31,0:00:45.23,Speech,,0,0,0,,And also, in a StarCraft, there was kind of crystals.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.69,0:00:47.49,Speech,,0,0,0,,You just need to find the crystals.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.49,0:00:50.85,Speech,,0,0,0,,And step by step, you just grow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.95,0:00:59.19,Speech,,0,0,0,,And then they get the full image numbers where you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.19,0:01:01.03,Speech,,0,0,0,,can see it in details.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.55,0:01:04.47,Speech,,0,0,0,,Why and what you spent.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.52,0:01:08.24,Speech,,0,0,0,,Because once you realize that your strategy is not
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.24,0:01:12.74,Speech,,0,0,0,,efficient comparing with the person's agents you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.74,0:01:16.82,Speech,,0,0,0,,play, you can use their strategy as your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.89,0:01:21.54,Speech,,0,0,0,,if you're using open source thing, please share it
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.54,0:01:22.12,Speech,,0,0,0,,with others.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.19,0:01:27.36,Speech,,0,0,0,,once you found the best and more efficient way
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.39,0:01:31.73,Speech,,0,0,0,,you need to share with the community.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.86,0:01:34.92,Speech,,0,0,0,,You need to show that it works in a certain way and
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.92,0:01:37.52,Speech,,0,0,0,,then people can use it and play it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.62,0:01:43.28,Speech,,0,0,0,,network effects, when a lot of people go and use
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.28,0:01:48.66,Speech,,0,0,0,,it and we see the data set of different ideas,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.67,0:01:54.89,Speech,,0,0,0,,helping community to understand more how to use these
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.89,0:01:59.23,Speech,,0,0,0,,agents in a very easy way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.15,0:00:08.50,Intro,,0,0,0,,AMIR\NTomorrow School student
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.65,0:00:18.05,Title,,0,0,0,,Learn to lead your AI helpers
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.65,0:00:18.05,Note,,0,0,0,,A game for people who own agents
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.05,0:00:24.92,Title,,0,0,0,,Two owners. Equal budgets.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.05,0:00:24.92,Note,,0,0,0,,Example: 10,000 tokens each
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.92,0:00:31.17,Title,,0,0,0,,Give your agents a job
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.92,0:00:31.17,Note,,0,0,0,,They work in parallel and report back
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.17,0:00:35.87,Title,,0,0,0,,You control the budget
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.17,0:00:35.87,Note,,0,0,0,,Your decisions shape how agents work
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.87,0:00:50.92,Title,,0,0,0,,Crystals = AI tokens
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.87,0:00:50.92,Note,,0,0,0,,Start small. Learn as your team grows.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.92,0:00:55.00,Title,,0,0,0,,See what your agents spent
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.92,0:00:55.00,Note,,0,0,0,,Failed work still consumes tokens
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.00,0:01:04.52,Title,,0,0,0,,2,634 tokens spent
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.00,0:01:04.52,Note,,0,0,0,,Separate measured test · 5 calls · quality check failed
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.52,0:01:16.89,Title,,0,0,0,,1. Use a shared strategy
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.52,0:01:16.89,Note,,0,0,0,,Product concept: learn from another player
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.89,0:01:31.77,Title,,0,0,0,,2. Share your improvement
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.89,0:01:31.77,Note,,0,0,0,,Build on someone else's plan? Publish what changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.77,0:01:37.57,Title,,0,0,0,,Show that it works
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.77,0:01:37.57,Note,,0,0,0,,Attach the result and the token cost
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.57,0:01:48.67,Title,,0,0,0,,3. The next owner can reuse it
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.57,0:01:48.67,Note,,0,0,0,,Goal: each contribution helps the next player
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.67,0:02:00.00,Title,,0,0,0,,ALASHI.network
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.67,0:02:00.00,Note,,0,0,0,,Learn from a game. Build on shared knowledge.
